#: app/views/index.scm:93
msgid "The WikiMusic project is an non-profit community, with the goal of knowledge sharing and musical education, providing an open platform for exploring, sharing, and learning about music in all its forms."
msgstr "The WikiMusic project is an non-profit community, with the goal of knowledge sharing and musical education, providing an open platform for exploring, sharing, and learning about music in all its forms."

#: app/views/index.scm:108
msgid "donate what you can, by clicking here"
msgstr "donate what you can, by clicking here"

#: app/views/index.scm:111
msgid "This helps us keep the underlying cloud infrastructure and the contributor's work hours going strong."
msgstr "This helps us keep the underlying cloud infrastructure and the contributor's work hours going strong."

#: app/views/index.scm:114
msgid "WikiMusic leverages a database-backed architecture to ensure all content is easily searchable, linkable, and reusable. "
msgstr "WikiMusic leverages a database-backed architecture to ensure all content is easily searchable, linkable, and reusable. "

#: app/views/index.scm:116
msgid "The user interface provides a seamless experience, inviting both beginners and experts to engage with the world of music collaboratively."
msgstr "The user interface provides a seamless experience, inviting both beginners and experts to engage with the world of music collaboratively."

#: app/views/index.scm:118
msgid "Join us in building an ever-growing library of musical knowledge — where every note tells a story."
msgstr "Join us in building an ever-growing library of musical knowledge — where every note tells a story."

#: app/views/index.scm:144
msgid "Whether you're a musician, educator, researcher, or simply a music lover, WikiMusic empowers you to:"
msgstr "Whether you're a musician, educator, researcher, or simply a music lover, WikiMusic empowers you to:"

#: app/views/index.scm:146
msgid "Discover music from diverse genres and traditions."
msgstr "Discover music from diverse genres and traditions."

#: app/views/index.scm:148
msgid "Organize information with structured metadata and multimedia content."
msgstr "Organize information with structured metadata and multimedia content."

#: app/views/index.scm:150
msgid "Contribute by adding new compositions, analyses, or educational materials."
msgstr "Contribute by adding new compositions, analyses, or educational materials."

#: app/views/index.scm:152
msgid "Learn through curated resources that connect music theory, history, and practice."
msgstr "Learn through curated resources that connect music theory, history, and practice."

#: app/views/index.scm:154
msgid "At its core, WikiMusic leverages the expressive power of Lisp to build a dynamic interactive Music Gallery and Content Management System (CMS)."
msgstr "At its core, WikiMusic leverages the expressive power of Lisp to build a dynamic interactive Music Gallery and Content Management System (CMS)."

